Package: umi-pd-mapper
Source: xiaomi-umi-bsp
Version: 1.0-umi1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Zhao_Wang
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), liblzma5, libqrtr1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Qualcomm PD mapper for Xiaomi Mi 10 (umi) audio bring-up
 Cross-compiled linux-msm/pd-mapper. Registers DSP protection-domain
 maps (parsed from the *.jsn files under /lib/firmware) over qrtr so the
 ADSP "avs/audio" PD announces via PDR. Without it no APR audio service
 device is created (q6afe/q6asm/...), the q6afecc clock tree never
 registers, and the sm8250 sound card stays deferred forever.
 .
 Mirrors pmOS's pd-mapper package for device-xiaomi-apollo.
